# ---- Large data ----
# GitHub rejects files over 100 MB. Keep big downloads in <module>/data/raw/
# and document the download steps in the module README.
**/data/raw/
**/data/external/
**/data/interim/
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.7z
*.rar
*.parquet
*.feather
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.onnx

